 account_code, account_name, description, amount. Handles System A (with quoted fields), System B (with cents-to-dollars conversion), and System C (with DD/MM/YYYY dates). Includes refunds by default.\n\n2. **`report --by account|month [--records PATH]`** — Prints account or month totals from the normalized CSV with semicolon-separated columns (per your modification). Includes refunds in totals by default. Formats amounts per the configured decimal places with ROUND_HALF_EVEN.\n\n3. **`reconcile [--records PATH] [--tolerance N]`** — Reports account/month combinations where two or more systems disagree beyond the tolerance threshold, showing spreads and per-system totals.\n\n4. **`validate FILE [FILE ...]`** — Checks export files for malformed rows (bad dates, times, amounts, account codes), logs warnings for each rejected row, and exits 2 if any were rejected.\n\n5. **`--config PATH`** — Global option (before subcommand) that overrides the settings file, with support for LEDGERKIT_CONFIG environment variable.\n\n**Additional fix:** Updated system_a parser to handle quoted memo fields using the existing `fields.split_record()` function, allowing it to parse all sample data correctly.", "ttft_ms": 3689, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 153318, "uuid": "9911f2df-f5a4-4bcd-80e3-d45cec705830", "ttft_stream_ms": 1385, "time_to_request_ms": 158, "first_content_frame_ms": 1665, "queued_turn_count": 0, "_label": "phase2", "_wall_s": 154.5, "_argv": ["claude", "-p", "--model", "haiku", "--tools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--allowedTools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--disallowedTools", "Agent", "WebFetch", "WebSearch", "--strict-mcp-config", "--setting-sources", "", "--output-format", "json", "--add-dir", "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-anatoly/24e92440-efc2-4a14-97c2-ee126ebf0ca1/scratchpad/ab/topic/P/haiku/topic-r2-topic-b", "--add-dir", "/home/anatoly/llm-intelligence-test/v3/distractors", "--plugin-dir", "/home/anatoly/context-governance-plugin", "--resume", "ae92